{"candidateAnswer":"Several production companies and a streaming platform's open submission program.","evidence":"[D2:7 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woohoo, Nate! I'm feeling a rollercoaster of emotions - relief, excitement, some anxiety - over finishing this project. Now I'm gonna submit it to some film festivals and (hopefully) get producers and directors to check it out. Here's hoping!\n[D16:1 | 10:55 am on 24 June, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! How have you been? I just got done submitting my recent screenplay to a film contest just to see how others might like it!","itemId":"urn:uuid:0169b9be-e1d7-5623-8738-304231347e99","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6e038449b63bb232555f460267cd58f3147dc675aeff0155f7960744e7f00626","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What places has Joanna submitted her work to?","referenceAnswer":"film contest, film festival.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6e038449b63bb232555f460267cd58f3147dc675aeff0155f7960744e7f00626"}}]}